OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over sexual assault   
OL,4,Aclaims at school in historical abuse   
OL,5,Aprobe                                  
OL,7,FA man has, been charged over assault   
OL,8,Fallegations in a wider investigation   
OL,9,Finto historical abuse at a private     
OL,10,Fschool in East Lothian, police have    
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,FThe person who cannot be named for     
OL,14,Flegal reasons, was charged in September
OL,15,Fas a part of Operation Dewdrop which is
OL,16,Ffocused on Loretto School in           
OL,17,FMusselburgh.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
