OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over sexual assault   
OL,4,Aclaims at school in historical abuse   
OL,5,Aprobe                                  
OL,7,FIt is understood four other former     
OL,8,Fmembers of staff at Scotland's oldest  
OL,9,Fboarding school are also under         
OL,10,Finvestigation for the sexual and       
OL,11,Fphysical assaults of children.         
OL,13,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said    
OL,14,Finquiries were ongoing. The Crown      
OL,15,FOffice and Procurator Fiscal Service   
OL,16,Fconfirmed that a report had been       
OL,17,Freceived which was under consideration.
